ndocrinology and her contributions to medical literature.DRA. SARA VALLE RODR√çGUEZ-NAVAS:Dra. Sara Valle Rodr√≠guez-Navas is a medical professional specializing in endocrinology and nutrition, currently practicing at Hospital Universitario de Araba in Vitoria-Gasteiz. She focuses on nutritional management for patients with type 1 diabetes and also provides care for individuals with rumination syndrome. Her expertise lies in managing the nutritional needs of these patients, ensuring they receive appropriate dietary guidance to support their health conditions.DRA. MERCEDES V√ÅZQUEZ GUTI√âRREZ:Dra. Mercedes V√°zquez Guti√©rrez is a specialist in endocrinology and nutrition at Complejo Hospitalario de Torrec√°rdenas in Almer√≠a. She is also an author of a clinical case that examines a patient with pancreatic intraductal papillary mucinous neoplasm, with a particular focus on issues of malnutrition and secondary diabetes.DRA. CONCEPCI√ìN VIDAL PERACHO:Dra. Concepci√≥n Vidal Peracho is a medical professional specializing in endocrinology and nutrition, currently practicing at Hospital Royo Villanova in Zaragoza. She focuses on the treatment of patients with diabetes, particularly type 1 diabetes, and emphasizes the importance of nutrition in managing cancer treatment for these patients. Dra. Vidal Peracho utilizes a continuous subcutaneous insulin infusion device as part of her approach to care, integrating her expertise in both nutrition and endocrinology to provide comprehensive support for her patients.DR. FRANCISCO VILLAZ√ìN GONZ√ÅLEZ:Dr. Francisco Villaz√≥n Gonz√°lez is a specialist in endocrinology and nutrition at Hospital Universitario Central de Asturias in Oviedo.DR. JUAN BAUTISTA MOLINA SORIA:Dr. Juan Bautista Molina Soria is the technical director and head of the Clinical Nutrition and Dietetics Unit at Hospital Universitario San Agust√≠n, located in Linares, Ja√©n.DRA. MERCEDES V√ÅZQUEZ("ENTITY":HOSPITAL UNIVERSITARIO SAN CECILIO:HOSPITAL UNIVERSITARIO SAN C