 in M\u00e1laga in 2020."}{"title": "INTERVENCI\u00d3N NUTRICIONAL MAYOR FR\u00c1GIL:The event refers to the document 'Intervenci\u00f3n nutricional mayor fr\u00e1gil' published by VEGENAT, which discusses nutritional interventions for fragile elderly individuals."}{"title": "15/10/2024:The date '15/10/2024' marks when the parsing of the document was completed."}{"title": "PDF:The document formats include PDF, which is one of the formats used for the documents mentioned."}{"title": "MD:The document formats include MD, which is one of the formats used for the documents mentioned."}{"title": "TXT:The document formats include TXT, which is one of the formats used for the documents mentioned."}{"title": "3-MINIVADEMECUM-NUTRICIONAL:"}{"title": "SOCIEDAD CASTELLANO LEONESA ENDOCRINOLOG\u00cdA, DIABETES Y NUTRICI\u00d3N:The Sociedad Castellano Leonesa de Endocrinolog\u00eda, Diabetes y Nutrici\u00f3n is an organization that supports clinical nutrition and diabetes education and research in the region of Castilla y Le\u00f3n."}{"title": "HOSPITAL UNIVERSITARIO Y POLIT\u00c9CNICO DE LA FE, VALENCIA:Hospital Universitario y Polit\u00e9cnico de La Fe in Valencia is a healthcare institution where Dr. Juan Francisco Merino Torres works as a head of the endocrinology and nutrition service."}{"title": "HOSPITAL CL\u00cdNICO UNIVERSITARIO LOZANO BLESAS, ZARAGOZA:Hospital Cl\u00ednico Universitario Lozano Blesa in Zaragoza is a healthcare institution where Dr. Julia Oc\u00f3n Bret\u00f3n works as a specialist in endocrinology and nutrition."}{"title": "HOSPITAL UNIVERSITARIO SAN CECILIO, GRANADA:Hospital Universitario San Cecilio in Granada is a healthcare institution where Dr. Mar\u00eda Luisa Fern\u00e1ndez Soto works as a specialist in endocrinology and nutrition."}{"title": "HOSPITAL UNIVERSITARIO MARQU\u00c9S DE VALDECILLA, CANTABRIA:Hospital Universitario Marqu\u00e9s de Valdecilla in Cantabria is a healthcare institution where Dr. \u00c1ngela Gonz\u00e1lez D\u00edaz-Faes works as a specialist in endocrinology and nutrition."}{"title": "HOSPITAL UNIVERSITARIO 12 DE OCTUBRE, MADRID:Hospital Universitario 12 de Octubre in Madrid is a healthcare institution where Dr. Miguel Le\u00f3n Sanz works as the head of the endocrinology and nutrition service."}{"title": "HOSPITAL UNIVERSITARIO MIGUEL SERVET, ZARAGOZA:Hospital Universitario Miguel Servet in Zaragoza is a healthcare institution where Dr. Francisco Losfablos Callau works as a specialist in endocrinology and nutrition."}{"title": "HOSPITAL CL\u00cdNICO UNIVERSITARIO DE VALLADOLID:The Hospital Cl\u00ednico Universitario de Valladolid is a prominent healthcare institution located in Valladolid, where it specializes in endocrinology and nutrition. Dr. Daniel A. de Luis Rom\u00e1n serves as the head of the endocrinology and nutrition service at this hospital. In addition to providing medical care, the hospital is actively involved in research related to endocrinology and nutrition, making it a key player in advancing knowledge and treatment in these fields. The institution is affiliated with various authors who contribute to its focus on these specialties."}{"title": "HOSPITAL UNIVERSITARIO DE SAN JUAN, ALICANTE:Hospital Universitario de San Juan in Alicante is a healthcare institution where Dr. Rosa M\u00aa Mirete L\u00f3pez works as a specialist in endocrinology and nutrition."}{"title": "HOSPITAL UNIVERSITARIO REINA SOF\u00cdA, C\u00d3RDOBA:Hospital Universitario Reina Sof\u00eda in C\u00f3rdoba is a healthcare institution where Dr. Mar\u00eda Jos\u00e9 Molina Puerta works as a specialist in endocrinology and nutrition."}{"title": "HOSPITAL SAN PEDRO, LA RIOJA:Hospital San Pedro in La Rioja is a healthcare institution where Dr. \u00c1ngela Mart\u00edn Palmero works as the head of the clinical nutrition and dietetics unit."}{"title": "DRA. MAR\u00cdA ARGENTE PLA:Dra. Mar\u00eda Argente Pla is a medical specialist in endocrinology and nutrition at Hospital Universitario y Polit\u00e9cnico de La Fe in Valencia. She is known for her expertise in treating patients with diabetes mellitus and cystic fibrosis, providing specialized care to manage these chronic conditions effectively."}{"title": "DRA. MAR\u00cdA D. BALLESTEROS POMAR:Dra. Mar\u00eda D. Ballesteros Pomar is a medical specialist in endocrinology and nutrition, currently practicing at the Complejo Asistencial Universitario de Le\u00f3n. She is recognized for her expertise in the field and has contributed to the medical community through her authorship of articles related to diabetes mellitus."}{"title": "DR. FERNANDO L. CALVO GRACIA:Dr. Fernando L. Calvo Gracia is a medical specialist in Endocrinology and Nutrition at Hospital Cl\u00ednico Universitario Lozano Blesa in Zaragoza. He is particularly involved in managing nutritional support for patients with pancreatic tumors, demonstrating his expertise in both endocrinology and nutrition within a clinical setting."}{"title": "DRA. M\u00aa VICTORIA GARC\u00cdA ZAFRA:Dra. M\u00aa Victoria Garc\u00eda Zafra is a medical specialist in endocrinology and nutrition at Hospital General Universitario Santa Luc\u00eda in Cartagena. She is recognized for her work in providing nutritional support, particularly for patients with complex conditions such as MELAS syndrome and diabetes. As an author of one of the clinical cases presented, she emphasizes the importance of tailored nutritional interventions in managing these intricate health issues."}{"title": "DRA. MAR\u00cdA LUISA FERN\u00c1NDEZ SOTO:Dra. Mar\u00eda Luisa Fern\u00e1ndez Soto is a highly regarded specialist in Endocrinology and Nutrition. She serves as the scientific director and coordinator of the Clinical Nutrition and Dietetics Unit at Hospital Universitario San Cecilio in Granada. Her expertise in the field is complemented by her leadership role within the hospital, where she oversees the clinical nutrition and dietetics services."}{"title": "DRA. \u00c1NGELA GONZ\u00c1LEZ D\u00cdAZ-FAES:Dra. \u00c1ngela Gonz\u00e1lez D\u00edaz-Faes is a medical professional specializing in endocrinology and nutrition at Hospital Universitario Marqu\u00e9s de Valdecilla in Cantabria. She manages nutritional care for patients with diabetes and other related conditions, providing essential nutritional support specifically for diabetic patients suffering from head and neck cancer. Her expertise encompasses a comprehensive approach to nutritional management, ensuring that her patients receive tailored care to address their unique health needs."}{"title": "DR. MIGUEL LE\u00d3N SANZ:Dr. Miguel Le\u00f3n Sanz is a distinguished medical professional specializing in oncology nutrition and endocrinology. He serves as the head of the endocrinology and nutrition service at Hospital Universitario 12 de Octubre in Madrid. In addition to his clinical responsibilities, Dr. Le\u00f3n Sanz is also an author and contributor to the medical field, actively engaging in research and advancements related to nutrition in oncology. His expertise encompasses both the nutritional aspects of cancer care and the broader field of endocrinology."}{"title": "DR. FRANCISCO LOSFABLOS CALLAU:Dr. Francisco Losfablos Callau is a medical specialist in endocrinology and nutrition, currently practicing at Hospital Universitario Miguel Servet in Zaragoza. He is recognized for his expertise in the field and has contributed to the medical community as a co-author of articles focused on diabetes mellitus."}{"title": "DR. DANIEL A. DE LUIS ROM\u00c1N:Dr. Daniel A. de Luis Rom\u00e1n is the scientific director and head of the endocrinology and nutrition service at Hospital Cl\u00ednico Universitario de Valladolid. In this role, he oversees the department's operations and contributes to advancements in the field of endocrinology and nutrition."}{"title": "DRA. \u00c1NGELA MART\u00cdN PALMERO:Dra. \u00c1ngela Mart\u00edn Palmero is the head of the Clinical Nutrition and Dietetics Unit at Hospital San Pedro in La Rioja. In her role, she emphasizes the management of diabetes and addresses issues related to disease-related malnutrition, ensuring comprehensive care for her patients."}{"title": "DR. JUAN FRANCISCO MERINO TORRES:Dr. Juan Francisco Merino Torres is a distinguished medical doctor specializing in endocrinology and nutrition. He serves as the head of the Endocrinology and Nutrition department at Hospital Universitario y Polit\u00e9cnico La Fe in Valencia, where he also holds the position of director cient\u00edfico. Dr. Merino Torres is recognized for his expertise in the field, particularly in relation to diabetes mellitus, and has contributed to the medical community through various published articles on the subject. His leadership at the hospital underscores his commitment to advancing the understanding and treatment of endocrine and nutritional disorders."}{"title": "DRA. ROSA M\u00aa MIRETE L\u00d3PEZ:Dra. Rosa M\u00aa Mirete L\u00f3pez is a medical specialist in endocrinology and nutrition at Hospital Universitario de San Juan in Alicante. She is known for her expertise in treating patients with diabetes mellitus and inflammatory bowel disease, providing specialized care to manage these conditions effectively."}{"title": "DRA. MAR\u00cdA JOS\u00c9 MOLINA PUERTA:Dra. Mar\u00eda Jos\u00e9 Molina Puerta is a medical specialist in endocrinology and nutrition at Hospital Universitario Reina Sof\u00eda in C\u00f3rdoba. She is also an author of a clinical case that discusses the interrelated issues of morbid obesity, diabetes, and bariatric surgery, highlighting her expertise in these critical areas of health."}{"title": "DRA. JULIA OC\u00d3N BRET\u00d3N:Dra. Julia Oc\u00f3n Bret\u00f3n is a specialist in clinical nutrition and endocrinology at the Hospital Cl\u00ednico Universitario Lozano Blesa in Zaragoza. She is responsible for the Clinical Nutrition and Dietetics Unit at this hospital, where she focuses on medical nutritional therapy."}{"title": "DR. CHRISTIAN SALOM VENDRELL:Dr. Christian Salom Vendrell is a medical doctor specializing in endocrinology and nutrition at Hospital Universitario Doctor Peset in Valencia. He focuses on providing nutritional support for patients with head and neck cancer, demonstrating his expertise in managing the dietary needs of this specific patient population. Additionally, he has been involved in clinical cases, including enteral nutrition for a diabetic patient diagnosed with laryngeal squamous cell carcinoma. Through his work, Dr. Vendrell plays a crucial role in integrating nutritional care into the treatment plans for patients facing complex health challenges."}{"title": "DR. \u00c1NGEL LUIS ABAD GONZ\u00c1LEZ:Dr. \u00c1ngel Luis Abad Gonz\u00e1lez is a medical specialist in Endocrinology and Nutrition, currently practicing at the Hospital General Universitario de Alicante. He specializes in treating patients with diabetes and other related conditions. Additionally, he is involved in clinical cases, including those related to gastrostomy."}{"title": "HOSPITAL GENERAL UNIVERSITARIO SANTA LUC\u00cdA, CARTAGENA:"}{"title": "HOSPITAL CL\u00cdNICO UNIVERSITARIO LOZANO BLESAS:Hospital Cl\u00ednico Universitario Lozano Blesa is a prominent clinical institution located in Zaragoza, Spain. It specializes in clinical nutrition and dietetics, as well as endocrinology. The hospital is directed by Dra. Julia Oc\u00f3n Bret\u00f3n, who oversees its focus on providing comprehensive care in these specialized fields. With its commitment to clinical nutrition and endocrinology, Hospital Cl\u00ednico Universitario Lozano Blesa plays a vital role in the healthcare landscape of Zaragoza."}{"title": "HOSPITAL UNIVERSITARIO DOCTOR PESET:Hospital Universitario Doctor Peset is a medical institution located in Valencia, Spain, that specializes in endocrinology and nutrition."}{"title": "HOSPITAL GENERAL UNIVERSITARIO DE VALENCIA:The Hospital General Universitario de Valencia is a medical facility located in Valencia, where Dr. Carlos S\u00e1nchez Juan serves as the head of the Endocrinology and Nutrition Service. This hospital is known for providing specialized services in the fields of endocrinology and nutrition, ensuring comprehensive care for patients in these areas."}{"title": "COMPLEJO ASISTENCIAL UNIVERSITARIO DE SALAMANCA:The Complejo Asistencial Universitario de Salamanca is a healthcare facility that specializes in endocrinology and nutrition. It serves as a significant institution in the region, providing specialized medical care in these fields. Additionally, it is the workplace of Dra. Ana Isabel S\u00e1nchez Marcos, a professional associated with the facility."}{"title": "HOSPITAL UNIVERSITARIO DE BURGOS:The Hospital Universitario de Burgos is a medical institution that specializes in endocrinology and nutrition. It is also the workplace of Estefan\u00eda Santos Mazo, who practices at this hospital."}{"title": "HOSPITAL GENERAL UNIVERSITARIO JOS\u00c9 M. MORALES MESEGUER:Hospital General Universitario Jos\u00e9 M. Morales Meseguer is a hospital in Murcia specializing in endocrinology and nutrition."}{"title": "HOSPITAL UNIVERSITARIO DE ARABA:Hospital Universitario de Araba (HUA) is a hospital located in Vitoria-Gasteiz specializing in endocrinology and nutrition."}{"title": "COMPLEJO HOSPITALARIO DE TORREC\u00c1RDENAS:Complejo Hospitalario de Torrec\u00e1rdenas is a hospital in Almer\u00eda specializing in endocrinology and nutrition."}{"title": "HOSPITAL ROYO VILLANOVA:Hospital Royo Villanova is a medical facility located in Zaragoza, Spain. It specializes in various health services, prominently including endocrinology and nutrition. Additionally, the hospital also offers specialized care in rheumatology, making it a comprehensive institution for a range of medical needs."}{"title": "DR. CARLOS S\u00c1NCHEZ JUAN:Dr. Carlos S\u00e1nchez Juan is a medical doctor who serves as the head of the Endocrinology and Nutrition department at Hospital General Universitario de Valencia. He holds the position of director cient\u00edfico and is responsible for overseeing the Endocrinology and Nutrition Service at the same hospital. His leadership role encompasses both clinical and scientific aspects of the department, highlighting his expertise and commitment to the field of endocrinology and nutrition."}{"title": "DRA. ANA ISABEL S\u00c1NCHEZ MARCOS:Dra. Ana Isabel S\u00e1nchez Marcos is a specialist in endocrinology and nutrition at Complejo Asistencial Universitario de Salamanca."}{"title": "DRA. ESTEFAN\u00cdA SANTOS MAZO:Dra. Estefan\u00eda Santos Mazo is a specialist in endocrinology and nutrition at Hospital Universitario de Burgos."}{"title": "DR. ALEJANDRO SANZ PAR\u00cdS:Dr. Alejandro Sanz Par\u00eds is the Director T\u00e9cnico and head of the Clinical Nutrition and Dietetics Unit at Hospital Universitario Miguel Servet in Zaragoza. He oversees the clinical nutrition and dietetics section, where he is responsible for managing and directing the unit's activities and ensuring the delivery of high-quality nutritional care."}{"title": "DRA. YAMINA SULEIMAN MARTOS:Dra. Yamina Suleiman Martos is a specialist in endocrinology and nutrition at Hospital General Universitario Jos\u00e9 M. Morales Meseguer in Murcia. She is also an author of a clinical case that addresses the relationship between diabetes and malabsorption, showcasing her expertise in the field of endocrinology and her contributions to medical literature."}{"title": "DRA. SARA VALLE RODR\u00cdGUEZ-NAVAS:Dra. Sara Valle Rodr\u00edguez-Navas is a medical professional specializing in endocrinology and nutrition, currently practicing at Hospital Universitario de Araba in Vitoria-Gasteiz. She focuses on nutritional management for patients with type 1 diabetes and also provides care for individuals with rumination syndrome. Her expertise lies in managing the nutritional needs of these patients, ensuring they receive appropriate dietary guidance to support their health conditions."}{"title": "DRA. MERCEDES V\u00c1ZQUEZ GUTI\u00c9RREZ:Dra. Mercedes V\u00e1zquez Guti\u00e9rrez is a specialist in endocrinology and nutrition at Complejo Hospitalario de Torrec\u00e1rdenas in Almer\u00eda. She is also an author of a clinical case that examines a patient with pancreatic intraductal papillary mucinous neoplasm, with a particular focus on issues of malnutrition and secondary diabetes."}{"title": "DRA. CONCEPCI\u00d3N VIDAL PERACHO:Dra. Concepci\u00f3n Vidal Peracho is a medical professional specializing in endocrinology and nutrition, currently practicing at Hospital Royo Villanova in Zaragoza. She focuses on the treatment of patients with diabetes, particularly type 1 diabetes, and emphasizes the importance of nutrition in managing cancer treatment for these patients. Dra. Vidal Peracho utilizes a continuous subcutaneous insulin infusion device as part of her approach to care, integrating her expertise in both nutrition and endocrinology to provide comprehensive support for her patients."}{"title": "DR. FRANCISCO VILLAZ\u00d3N GONZ\u00c1LEZ:Dr. Francisco Villaz\u00f3n Gonz\u00e1lez is a specialist in endocrinology and nutrition at Hospital Universitario Central de Asturias in Oviedo."}{"title": "DR. JUAN BAUTISTA MOLINA SORIA:Dr. Juan Bautista Molina Soria is the technical director and head of the Clinical Nutrition and Dietetics Unit at Hospital Universitario San Agust\u00edn, located in Linares, Ja\u00e9n."}{"title": "DRA. MERCEDES V\u00c1ZQUEZ(\"ENTITY\":"}{"title": "HOSPITAL UNIVERSITARIO SAN CECILIO:HOSPITAL UNIVERSITARIO SAN CECILIO is a university hospital situated in Granada, Spain. It specializes in a range of medical fields, with a particular focus on endocrinology and nutrition."}{"title": "HOSPITAL UNIVERSITARIO SAN AGUST\u00cdN:Hospital Universitario San Agust\u00edn is a university hospital situated in Linares, Ja\u00e9n, Spain. It specializes in clinical nutrition and dietetics, with Dr. Juan Bautista Molina Soria serving as the head of the Clinical Nutrition and Dietetics Unit. The hospital is dedicated to providing comprehensive healthcare services, emphasizing the importance of nutrition in patient care."}{"title": "HOSPITAL SAN PEDRO:Hospital San Pedro is a healthcare facility located in La Rioja, where Dr. \u00c1ngela Mart\u00edn Palmero serves as the head of the Clinical Nutrition and Dietetics Unit. This clinical institution is dedicated to providing specialized care in the fields of clinical nutrition and dietetics, under the expert direction of Dr. Mart\u00edn Palmero."}{"title": "DR. \u00c1NGELA MART\u00cdN PALMERO:Director cient\u00edfica and head of the Clinical Nutrition and Dietetics Unit at Hospital San Pedro."}{"title": "DR. JULIA OC\u00d3N BRET\u00d3N:Director cient\u00edfica and head of the Clinical Nutrition and Dietetics Unit at Hospital Cl\u00ednico Universitario Lozano Blesa."}{"title": "MESA REDONDA DE CASOS CL\u00cdNICOS. NORTE:A round table event discussing clinical cases related to nutrition and diabetes management."}{"title": "DIETA TERAP\u00c9UTICA:A specialized diet designed to manage specific health conditions, such as diabetes or cancer.)<|COMPLETE|>"}{"title": "MIGUEL LE\u00d3N SANZ:Miguel Le\u00f3n Sanz is a medical professional specializing in endocrinology and nutrition at Hospital Universitario 12 de Octubre. He holds the position of President of the Sociedad Espa\u00f1ola de Nutrici\u00f3n Cl\u00ednica y Metabolismo (SENPE), where he is actively involved in the fields of clinical nutrition and metabolism."}{"title": "SOCIEDAD ESPA\u00d1OLA DE NUTRICI\u00d3N CL\u00cdNICA Y METABOLISMO:The Sociedad Espa\u00f1ola de Nutrici\u00f3n Cl\u00ednica y Metabolismo (SENPE) is an organization focused on improving clinical nutrition and metabolism practices in Spain."}{"title": "HEMOGLOBINA GLICOSILADA:HEMOGLOBINA GLICOSILADA, also known as glycated hemoglobin, is a form of hemoglobin that is chemically linked to glucose. It serves as a crucial blood test that reflects average blood sugar levels over the past three months, making it an important tool for managing diabetes. This measure is used to assess long-term glucose control in individuals with diabetes, and it can be positively influenced by dietary choices, such as the Mediterranean diet. Overall, HEMOGLOBINA GLICOSILADA is a key marker in diabetes management, providing valuable insights into a patient's blood sugar levels over an extended period."}{"title": "GRADUADOS EN NUTRICI\u00d3N HUMANA Y DIET\u00c9TICA:Graduates in Human Nutrition and Dietetics are professionals trained to provide dietary advice and nutritional therapy."}{"title": "ESPECIALISTAS EN ENDOCRINOLOG\u00cdA Y NUTRICI\u00d3N:Specialists in Endocrinology and Nutrition are healthcare professionals with expertise in hormonal and nutritional management of patients."}{"title": "OBJETIVOS NUTRICIONALES:The \"OBJETIVOS NUTRICIONALES\" refer to specific dietary goals established to enhance the health and nutritional status of patients. These objectives are particularly important for individuals with inflammatory bowel disease, as they aim to improve their overall health and nutritional well-being. Additionally, these nutritional goals are also tailored for patients managing diabetes, focusing on improving their health outcomes through targeted dietary interventions. Overall, the \"OBJETIVOS NUTRICIONALES\" encompass a range of specific targets designed to address the unique dietary needs of patients with various health conditions."}{"title": "FORMACI\u00d3N EN NUTRICI\u00d3N CL\u00cdNICA:Training in clinical nutrition is essential for healthcare professionals to effectively manage patients' dietary needs."}{"title": "HOSPITAL CL\u00cdNICO UNIVERSITARIO LOZANO BLESA:The University Clinical Hospital Lozano Blesa in Zaragoza provides healthcare services and is involved in clinical nutrition and dietetics."}{"title": "ZARAGOZA:Zaragoza is a city in Spain that is home to the Hospital Cl\u00ednico Universitario Lozano Blesa, which serves as a prominent center for medical research and treatment. Additionally, this hospital is affiliated with the University, further emphasizing its role in the healthcare and educational landscape of the region."}{"title": "EUROPE:Europe is a diverse continent characterized by a wide range of legislation and funding related to home artificial nutrition, reflecting the varying health policies of its countries. It serves as a focal point for nutritional guidelines and legal standards concerning food products, which are essential for public health. The continent is also a significant area of study for cardiovascular disease, with ongoing epidemiological updates and initiatives like the SCORE project aimed at estimating cardiovascular disease risk.\n\nDiabetes prevalence is a major health concern in Europe, affecting millions of individuals, while hemochromatosis is notably more common in northern regions. The rates of obesity vary across Europe, with some countries experiencing higher prevalence than others. Additionally, the population exhibits differing levels of lactase persistence, particularly in northern and western areas, which influences dietary habits and health outcomes.\n\nRegulations regarding the production and labeling of organic products, including gluten-free certifications, are established within Europe, ensuring consumer safety and product integrity. The continent has also seen significant variations in the prevalence of non-communicable diseases (NPD) among countries, as noted in studies from 1993. Disease-related malnutrition remains a pressing public health issue, prompting various studies and surveys, including those focused on cystic fibrosis.\n\nOverall, Europe is a continent marked by its complex health landscape, diverse nutritional challenges, and regulatory frameworks that aim to address these issues effectively."}{"title": "SOPORTE NUTRICIONAL ESPECIALIZADO:Specialized nutritional support refers to medical nutritional therapy that includes oral nutritional supplements, enteral nutrition, and parenteral nutrition."}{"title": "SNO:SNO refers to oral nutritional supplements designed to support the dietary needs of patients, particularly those at risk of malnutrition. These specialized nutritional supplements are administered orally and are particularly beneficial for patients with malnutrition, those preparing for surgery, and individuals managing diabetes. SNO encompasses a range of nutritional formulas tailored to enhance dietary intake, providing essential calories and nutrients necessary for recovery and overall health. Additionally, SNO includes specific nutritional support for patients undergoing cancer treatment, ensuring that their unique dietary requirements are met. Overall, SNO plays a crucial role in improving the nutritional status of patients in various medical contexts."}{"title": "MALNUTRICI\u00d3N RELACIONADA CON LA ENFERMEDAD:MALNUTRICI\u00d3N RELACIONADA CON LA ENFERMEDAD, also known as disease-related malnutrition (DRE), is a condition characterized by a compromised nutritional status in patients due to illness. This condition significantly impacts clinical outcomes and contributes to increased healthcare costs. DRE is recognized as a major public health issue, particularly in developed countries, where it is associated with heightened risks of morbidity and mortality."}{"title": "ENFERMOS MAYORES DE 70 A\u00d1OS:Patients over 70 years old are significantly affected by disease-related malnutrition, with a prevalence of 37% according to the PREDYCES study."}{"title": "POLIMEDICACI\u00d3N:Polypharmacy is a risk factor for disease-related malnutrition, particularly in elderly and complex chronic patients."}{"title": "NOURISH:The NOURISH study is a recent multicenter clinical trial examining the effects of a hyperproteic nutritional supplement enriched with beta-hydroxy-beta-methylbutyrate on malnourished elderly patients in hospitals."}{"title": "PHILIPSON ET AL.:Philipson et al. conducted an analysis of hospital admission records of 44 million hospitalized patients in the U.S. over 11 years, focusing on the impact of oral nutritional supplements on hospital stays and readmission rates."}{"title": "ELIA ET AL.:Elia et al. published systematic reviews and meta-analyses regarding the use of oral nutritional supplements in hospitalized and community patients with various pathologies."}{"title": "BALLY ET AL.:Bally et al. conducted a systematic review and meta-analysis on nutritional support and outcomes in malnourished medical inpatients."}{"title": "MALNOURISHED PATIENTS:Malnourished patients are individuals who are hospitalized and at risk of complications due to inadequate nutritional intake. They are characterized by not receiving sufficient nutrition, which often necessitates specialized nutritional support. This support may include interventions such as parenteral nutrition to address their nutritional deficiencies and mitigate the risks associated with malnutrition."}{"title": "HOSPITAL READMISSIONS:Hospital readmissions refer to the instances when patients return to the hospital after discharge, which is a key metric evaluated in studies regarding the effectiveness of nutritional supplements."}{"title": "HYPERPROTEIC NUTRITIONAL SUPPLEMENT:"}{"title": "MAR\u00cdA D. BALLESTEROS POMAR:Mar\u00eda D. Ballesteros Pomar is a medical specialist in Endocrinology and Nutrition, and the coordinator of the Nutrition Area of the SEEN at the Complejo Asistencial Universitario de Le\u00f3n."}{"title": "CASTILLA Y LE\u00d3N:Castilla y Le\u00f3n is an autonomous community in Spain that is currently facing a significant increase in the prevalence of diabetes and related mortality rates. This region is characterized by an aging population, which contributes to the growing health concern surrounding diabetes. In response to this issue, clinical case conferences have been held in Castilla y Le\u00f3n to address the challenges posed by this condition. Additionally, patients in the region are required to submit a justification report from a hospital specialist in order to continue receiving treatment for their nutritional needs, highlighting the structured approach to managing diabetes and its complications within the community."}{"title": "IDF:The International Diabetes Federation (IDF) is an organization dedicated to providing data and advocacy related to diabetes on a global scale. It plays a crucial role in raising awareness and promoting education about diabetes through its various initiatives. One of its key contributions is the publication of the Atlas of Diabetes, which offers comprehensive global epidemiological data on the prevalence and impact of diabetes worldwide. Through these efforts, the IDF aims to improve the understanding of diabetes and support efforts to combat this growing health issue."}{"title": "XXIX CONGRESO NACIONAL DE LA SOCIEDAD ESPA\u00d1OLA DE DIABETES:The XXIX National Congress of the Spanish Diabetes Society is a significant event focused on diabetes research and awareness. During this congress, the results of the di@bet.es study were presented, highlighting important findings related to diabetes management and care. Additionally, the congress served as a platform for presenting new data on the prevalence of diabetes in Spain, contributing to the understanding of the disease's impact within the country. This event underscores the ongoing efforts of the Spanish Diabetes Society to advance knowledge and improve outcomes for individuals affected by diabetes."}{"title": "DIABETES ATLAS:The Diabetes Atlas is a publication by the IDF that provides comprehensive data on the global prevalence of diabetes."}{"title": "SOCIEDAD ESPA\u00d1OLA DE DIABETES:The Spanish Diabetes Society is an organization that focuses on diabetes research and education, hosting the XXIX National Congress to discuss diabetes prevalence and management."}{"title": "EMERGING RISK FACTORS COLLABORATION:The Emerging Risk Factors Collaboration is a research group that studies the impact of various health factors, including diabetes, on mortality rates."}{"title": "COHORT DE DIABETES MELLITUS DE CASTILLA Y LE\u00d3N:The Diabetes Mellitus Cohort of Castilla y Le\u00f3n is a study initiated in 2000 to track new diabetes diagnoses and their long-term health impacts."}{"title": "RIESGO DE ENFERMEDAD CARDIOVASCULAR EN CASTILLA Y LE\u00d3N:The Risk of Cardiovascular Disease in Castilla y Le\u00f3n study examines the relationship between diabetes and cardiovascular health over a decade."}{"title": "POBLACI\u00d3N:Poblaci\u00f3n refers to a group of individuals that are the subject of study in research, particularly in cross-sectional studies. In the context of Castilla y Le\u00f3n, the term specifically pertains to the general public, with a focus on those affected by diabetes and its related health issues. This dual perspective highlights the importance of understanding both the broader demographic and the specific health challenges faced by certain segments of the population."}{"title": "DR. SHAUKAT SADIKOT:Dr. Shaukat Sadikot was the president of the IDF during 2016-2017 and emphasized the global crisis of diabetes."}{"title": "GASTO SANITARIO:Healthcare spending related to diabetes in Spain, which includes both direct and indirect costs associated with the disease."}{"title": "COSTES INDIRECTOS:Indirect costs associated with diabetes, including absenteeism and early retirements, which impact the economy."}{"title": "COSTES DIRECTOS:Direct costs related to diabetes treatments and hospitalizations, which are a significant part of healthcare expenditure."}{"title": "PRESIDENTE DE LA IDF:The title refers to the leader of the International Diabetes Federation, who plays a crucial role in advocating for diabetes awareness and management."}{"title": "COHORTE DE DIABETES MELLITUS DE CASTILLA Y LE\u00d3N:CODICYL is a diabetes cohort study in the region of Castilla y Le\u00f3n, Spain, focusing on diabetes-related health issues and outcomes."}{"title": "FEDERACI\u00d3N ESPA\u00d1OLA DE DIABETES:FEDE is a Spanish federation that provides resources and information about diabetes, aiming to improve the quality of life for people with diabetes in Spain."}{"title": "ALEJANDRO SANZ PAR\u00cdS:Alejandro Sanz Par\u00eds is a distinguished medical professional serving as the Head of the Endocrinology and Nutrition Section at Hospital Universitario Miguel Servet in Zaragoza. He specializes in nutrition and dietetics, with a particular focus on diabetes care. In addition to his role as head of the Endocrinology and Nutrition Section, Dr. Sanz Par\u00eds also holds the position of technical director and leads the Clinical Nutrition and Dietetics Unit at the same hospital. His expertise and leadership contribute significantly to the management and treatment of nutritional and dietary needs in patients."}{"title": "FRANCISCO LOSFABLOS CALLAU:Dr. Francisco Losfablos Callau is a medical professional specializing in nutrition and dietetics, working alongside Dr. Alejandro Sanz Par\u00eds at Hospital Universitario Miguel Servet."}{"title": "OLVEIRA ET AL.:Olveira et al. conducted a study in Spain that focused on two main aspects related to hospitalized patients, particularly those with diabetes. The first aspect of their research observed the prevalence of enteral nutrition among these patients, highlighting its significance in their care. Additionally, the study examined the costs associated with diabetes care in hospitalized patients, providing insights into the financial implications of managing diabetes in a hospital setting. Through their comprehensive analysis, Olveira et al. contributed valuable information to the understanding of nutritional and economic factors affecting diabetes care in Spain."}{"title": "SANZ PARIS ET AL.:Sanz Par\u00eds et al. conducted a significant study in 2013 on malnutrition prevalence among hospitalized diabetic patients in Spain."}{"title": "COSTES DE ATENCI\u00d3N DE LA SALUD:Healthcare costs associated with diabetes in Spain, which were studied to understand the economic impact of the disease."}{"title": "HOSPITALES:Hospitals are healthcare institutions dedicated to providing treatment and care for patients, including those who require specialized services such as parenteral nutrition and catheter insertion. They often operate under management contracts to deliver a range of medical services. In addition to medical care, hospitals also serve food products, such as Galleta Maria, and must provide allergen information to ensure patient safety. In Spain, hospitals are involved in research studies focusing on diabetes and malnutrition among patients, highlighting their role in evaluating and addressing nutritional needs through initiatives like Nutrition Day. Overall, hospitals are essential institutions that not only deliver health services but also prioritize the nutritional well-being of their patients."}{"title": "GASTO TOTAL DEL SISTEMA NACIONAL DE SALUD:Total expenditure of the National Health System in Spain, which includes costs related to diabetes management."}{"title": "\u00daLCERAS DE DEC\u00daBITO:Pressure ulcers that are a significant concern for diabetic patients, as highlighted in various studies."}{"title": "RIESGO DE AMPUTACI\u00d3N:Risk of amputation associated with diabetes, particularly in patients with diabetic foot complications."}{"title": "MEDICARE:Medicare is a U.S. federal health insurance program that provides coverage primarily for individuals aged 65 and older, as well as some younger individuals with disabilities. The program is designed to assist with healthcare costs and has been involved in studies related to various health conditions, including diabetes and malnutrition. Medicare offers essential support for individuals with diabetes and other medical conditions, ensuring access to necessary healthcare services."}{"title": "GERIATRIC RESIDENCE:Geriatric residences are facilities that provide care for elderly individuals, often focusing on their specific health needs, including diabetes management and nutritional support."}{"title": "HOSPITAL UNIVERSITARIO PUERTA DEL MAR:Hospital Universitario Puerta del Mar is a hospital located in C\u00e1diz, Spain, involved in diabetes research and treatment."}{"title": "JUAN OLIVA:Juan Oliva is a researcher who has contributed to studies on the direct health care costs of diabetic patients in Spain."}{"title": "F\u00c9LIX LOBO:F\u00e9lix Lobo is a researcher involved in diabetes care studies in Spain."}{"title": "BEGO\u00d1A MOLINA:Bego\u00f1a Molina is a researcher who has worked on diabetes-related health care costs in Spain."}{"title": "SUSANA MONEREO:Susana Monereo is a researcher contributing to studies on diabetes in Spain."}{"title": "MIGUEL RUIZ-RAMOS:Miguel Ruiz-Ramos is a researcher focused on diabetes mortality, prevalence, and economic costs in Spain."}{"title": "ANTONIO ESCOLAR-PUJOLAR:Antonio Escolar-Pujolar is a researcher involved in diabetes studies in Spain."}{"title": "EDUARDO MAYORAL-SANCH\u00c9Z:Eduardo Mayoral-Sanch\u00e9z is a researcher studying diabetes in Spain."}{"title": "FLORENTINO CORRAL LAUREANO:Florentino Corral Laureano is a researcher who has contributed to diabetes studies in Spain."}{"title": "ISABEL FERN\u00c1NDEZ-FERN\u00c1NDEZ:Isabel Fern\u00e1ndez-Fern\u00e1ndez is a researcher involved in diabetes research in Spain."}{"title": "SANZ PAR\u00cdS A:Sanz Par\u00eds A is a researcher studying malnutrition prevalence in hospitalized elderly diabetic patients."}{"title": "GARC\u00cdA JM:Garc\u00eda JM is a researcher involved in studies on malnutrition in diabetic patients."}{"title": "GOMEZ-CANDELA C:Gomez-Candela C is a researcher studying malnutrition in hospitalized diabetic patients."}{"title": "MART\u00cdN A:Mart\u00edn A is a researcher involved in studies on malnutrition in elderly diabetic patients."}{"title": "MAT\u00cdA P:Mat\u00eda P is a researcher studying malnutrition in hospitalized diabetic patients."}{"title": "GLUCOSE REGULATION:Impaired glucose regulation is a condition related to diabetes that affects how the body manages blood sugar levels, as discussed in the studies."}{"title": "HOSPITAL DISCHARGE RECORDS:Hospital discharge records are documents that summarize a patient's hospital stay and are mentioned in the context of under-reporting diabetes prevalence."}{"title": "INPATIENT GLYCEMIC CONTROL:Inpatient glycemic control refers to the management of blood sugar levels in hospitalized patients, a topic covered in the studies."}{"title": "DIABETES RESEARCH AND CLINICAL PRACTICE:Diabetes Research and Clinical Practice is a journal dedicated to publishing research and studies focused on diabetes management and treatment. It serves as a platform for disseminating findings related to various aspects of diabetes, including innovative management strategies and clinical research."}{"title": "NUTRITION HOSPITAL:NUTRITION HOSPITAL is a journal dedicated to the field of nutrition, emphasizing its critical role in health and disease management. The journal covers a wide range of topics within clinical nutrition and dietetics, offering recommendations and research studies that pertain to nutritional support. It particularly focuses on nutritional practices and interventions in clinical settings, with a special emphasis on patients with eating disorders. Additionally, NUTRITION HOSPITAL publishes research on the dietary impacts on health, including studies related to parenteral nutrition and the nutritional aspects of diabetes management in hospitalized patients. Overall, the journal serves as a vital resource for understanding the implications of nutrition in various clinical contexts."}{"title": "STUDY VIDA:Study VIDA group focuses on the application of the new ESPEN definition of malnutrition in geriatric diabetic patients during hospitalization."}{"title": "PAN-EUROPEAN PRESSURE ULCER STUDY:A study that investigates intrinsic and extrinsic risk factors for hip fractures and pressure ulcers across Europe."}{"title": "NATIONAL MEDICARE PATIENT SAFETY MONITORING SYSTEM:A system that monitors hospital-acquired pressure ulcers in Medicare patients."}{"title": "SHELTER STUDY:The SHELTER study examines the characteristics of diabetic residents in European nursing homes."}{"title": "ISRAEL:Country where a study on the prevalence and characteristics of malnutrition among community-dwelling older adults was conducted."}{"title": "THE NETHERLANDS:Country where the annual national prevalence measurement of care problems related to malnutrition was conducted."}{"title": "JULIA AH:Julia AH is a researcher contributing to the analysis of hospital malnutrition in diabetic patients."}{"title": "MERC\u00c8 P:Merc\u00e8 P is a researcher participating in the study of malnutrition prevalence in diabetic patients."}{"title": "ABELARDO GL:Abelardo GL is a researcher involved in the PREDyCES study on hospital malnutrition."}{"title": "KRYSMARU A:Krysmaru A is a researcher contributing to the study of malnutrition in diabetic patients."}{"title": "SEBASTI\u00c1N C:Sebasti\u00e1n C is a researcher involved in the analysis of hospital malnutrition in patients with diabetes mellitus."}{"title": "GAU BR:Gau BR is a researcher studying the impact of nutritional status on treatment outcomes for diabetic foot ulcers."}{"title": "CHEN HY:Chen HY is a researcher contributing to the study of nutritional status in diabetic patients."}{"title": "HUNG SY:Hung SY is a researcher involved in the study of treatment outcomes for patients with limb-threatening diabetic foot ulcers."}{"title": "YANG HM:Yang HM is a researcher studying the impact of nutritional status on diabetic patients."}{"title": "YEH JT:Yeh JT is a researcher contributing to the study of diabetic foot ulcers."}{"title": "HUANG CH:Huang CH is a researcher involved in the study of diabetic foot ulcers."}{"title": "SUN JH:Sun JH is a researcher studying the impact of nutritional status on diabetic patients."}{"title": "HUANG YY:Huang YY is a researcher contributing to the study of treatment outcomes for diabetic foot ulcers."}{"title": "LINDHOLM C:Lindholm C is a researcher involved in the Pan-European Pressure Ulcer Study."}{"title": "STERNE E:Sterner E is a researcher contributing to the study of pressure ulcers and hip fractures."}{"title": "ROMANELLI M:Romanelli M is a researcher involved in the Pan-European Pressure Ulcer Study."}{"title": "PINA E:Pina E is a researcher contributing to the study of risk factors for pressure ulcers."}{"title": "TORRA Y BOU J:Torra y Bou J is a researcher involved in the study of pressure ulcers."}{"title": "HIETANEN H:Hietanen H is a researcher contributing to the Pan-European Pressure Ulcer Study."}{"title": "IIVANAINEN A:Iivanainen A is a researcher involved in the study of pressure ulcers."}{"title": "GUNNINGBERG L:Gunningberg L is a researcher contributing to the study of risk factors for pressure ulcers."}{"title": "HOMMEL A:Hommel A is a researcher involved in the Pan-European Pressure Ulcer Study."}{"title": "KLANG B:Klang B is a researcher contributing to the study of pressure ulcers."}{"title": "DEALEY C:Dealey C is a researcher involved in the study of pressure ulcers."}{"title": "COX J:Cox J is a researcher reviewing literature on pressure injury risk factors in critical care patients."}{"title": "LIU P:Liu P is a researcher conducting a meta-analysis on diabetes mellitus as a risk factor for pressure ulcers."}{"title": "HE W:He W is a researcher contributing to the study of diabetes mellitus and pressure ulcers."}{"title": "CHEN HL:Chen HL is a researcher involved in the study of diabetes mellitus and surgery-related pressure ulcers."}{"title": "CASIMIRO C:Casimiro C is a researcher involved in the study of nutritional status in elderly patients with diabetes."}{"title": "US\u00c1N L:Us\u00e1n L is a researcher involved in the study of nutritional s